    <string key="tour.0.title">Hit the gas</string>
    <string key="tour.0.keys"><![CDATA[Hold <kbd>↑</kbd> or <kbd>W</kbd> until your speed passes 45. Let go and the car keeps that speed.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.1.title">Change lanes</string>
    <string key="tour.1.keys"><![CDATA[Use <kbd>←</kbd> and <kbd>→</kbd> (or <kbd>A</kbd> and <kbd>D</kbd>) to move to another lane.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.1.touch">Move the stick left or right to change lanes. A short push moves you one lane.</string>
    <string key="tour.2.title">Brake</string>
    <string key="tour.2.keys"><![CDATA[Press <kbd>↓</kbd> or <kbd>S</kbd> to slow down. The car keeps the new speed.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.2.touch">Pull the stick down to slow down. The car keeps the new speed.</string>
    <string key="tour.3.title">Horn</string>
    <string key="tour.3.keys"><![CDATA[Press <kbd>Space</kbd>. The car ahead moves over if the lane next to it is free.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.3.touch"><![CDATA[Press the round <b>horn</b> button. The car ahead moves over if the lane next to it is free.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.4.title">Speed</string>
    <string key="tour.4.body">The big number is your speed and the red circle is the limit. When the number turns red, the camera will catch you. A yellow sign shows before each camera.</string>
    <string key="tour.5.title">Where to</string>
    <string key="tour.5.body">This shows where you're going and how far is left. In free drive it shows how far you've gone.</string>
    <string key="tour.6.title">Points and fines</string>
    <string key="tour.6.body">Points grow with distance and close passes. Cameras and crashes cost fines instead. If damage fills up, the car breaks down.</string>
    <string key="tour.7.title">Map</string>
    <string key="tour.8.title">Close passes</string>
    <string key="tour.8.body">Pass cars close while going faster than them to earn points. Several in a row multiply the points.</string>
    <string key="tour.9.title">Pause</string>
    <string key="tour.9.keys"><![CDATA[Pause the game here and change the camera and sound. <kbd>C</kbd> changes the camera and <kbd>P</kbd> pauses.]]></string>
    <string key="tour.9.touch">Pause the game here and change the camera, horn side and sound.</string>
