    <string key="page.T_C_LANES">Buttons</string>
    <string key="page.T_C_STICK_D">A round stick at the bottom. Push up to speed up, pull down to brake, and move it sideways to change lanes. Let go and the car keeps its speed.</string>
    <string key="page.T_C_ONE_D">Put your thumb anywhere on the lower part of the screen and drag: up to speed up, down to brake, sideways to change lanes.</string>
    <string key="page.T_C_TILT_D">Tilt the phone like a steering wheel to change lanes. Drag up anywhere to speed up and down to brake.</string>
    <string key="page.T_C_LANES_D">Arrow buttons change lanes, one tap per lane, with separate gas and brake pedals.</string>
    <string key="page.T_TILTPERM">Allow motion access to steer by tilting.</string>
    <string key="page.T_NOTILT">This device has no tilt sensor, so the stick steers instead.</string>
