  <landing>
    <string key="title">SZR Autostrad</string>
    <string key="h1">Drive the roads of Amman, Dubai and Riyadh</string>
    <string key="intro">Three 3D driving games on real roads. Pick a city, pick a trip between its landmarks, and pass cars without crashing or getting caught by a speed camera. Plays in the browser on a computer or a phone.</string>
    <string key="play">Play</string>
    <string key="how1t">Driving</string>
    <string key="how1"><![CDATA[<kbd>↑</kbd> gas, <kbd>↓</kbd> brake, <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> change lane, <kbd>Space</kbd> horn, <kbd>N</kbd> nitro. On a phone, use the buttons on screen.]]></string>
    <string key="how2t">Points</string>
    <string key="how2">Every kilometer earns points. Close, fast passes earn more, and passes in a row multiply them.</string>
    <string key="how3t">Fines</string>
    <string key="how3">Speed cameras, crashes, scraping the barrier and speed bumps cost fines and damage the car.</string>
    <string key="how4t">First time?</string>
    <string key="how4">The game starts with a short guided tour that teaches every control while you drive.</string>
    <string key="footer">The roads roughly follow real places.</string>
    <string key="code">Code on GitHub</string>
  </landing>
